options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL         Model spec in format
                        'name|model_type|checkpoint_path'. Repeat --model to
                        evaluate multiple models in one run.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
                        Path to NeMo checkpoint directory for single-model
                        mode. Ignored when --model is provided.
  --model-type {ssa_triton,ssa,softmax}
                        Single-model mode type used with --checkpoint
                        (choices: ('ssa_triton', 'ssa', 'softmax')).
  --model-name MODEL_NAME
                        Optional display name for single-model mode
                        (--checkpoint).
  --tasks TASKS         Comma-separated list of tasks or group name (quick,
                        standard, leaderboard, superglue_core, superglue,
                        french_bench, french_bench_perplexity,
                        french_bench_all, all)
  --tokenizer TOKENIZER
                        Tokenizer name or path
  --device DEVICE       Device to load model on
  --batch_size BATCH_SIZE
                        Batch size for evaluation
  --max_length MAX_LENGTH
                        Maximum sequence length
  --num_fewshot NUM_FEWSHOT
                        Number of few-shot examples (overrides task defaults)
  --limit LIMIT         Limit examples per task
  --gsm8k-limit GSM8K_LIMIT
                        When gsm8k is selected, evaluate only this many
                        examples. Set to 0 or a negative number to disable
                        gsm8k-specific override.
  --gsm8k-random-seed GSM8K_RANDOM_SEED
                        Seed used for gsm8k subset evaluation randomness.
  --output OUTPUT       Path to save results JSON
  --compiled-bda, --no-compiled-bda
                        Enable compiled bias-dropout-add path used in SSA
                        Triton layer spec
  --force-contiguous-qkv, --no-force-contiguous-qkv
                        Materialize contiguous Q/K/V tensors before Triton
                        attention kernel
  --enforce-bf16, --no-enforce-bf16
                        Convert loaded benchmark model weights to bfloat16 for
